  "updated_at": "2026-04-13",
  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Sioux Falls, Red Arbor Tattoo is a sanctuary of creativity specializing in black & gray and realism tattoos. Our team of distinguished artists—Cody Tweedy, Cory Claussen, Ryan Tieszen, Sam Mock, Indeathium, and Coyote Harvest—crafts each design with unparalleled precision and care. Please note: Appointments are exclusively made in person or over the phone, keeping our focus on the art and your experience as intimate as the masterpiece on your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Sioux Falls, South Dakota, United States\n\nTea, SD\n@coryclaussentattoos | @park_portfolio | @miss.mia.tattoos | @madlibstattoos | @s.layne.inks | @aidens.art.stuff | @rabbittoothstudio\nBook ⬇️",
